rmc-fax-responder-rules-title = Fax Responder
rmc-fax-responder-rules-heading = Before you begin
rmc-fax-responder-rules-text = Please read the [bold]Fax Responders[/bold] rules in the guidebook before responding to any faxes.

    Your job is to answer faxes sent to your fax machine. You are answering on behalf of the RMC14 admin team and are therefore held to the highest standards. [bold]Failure to adhere to expectations or failing to follow these guidelines may result in no longer being allowed to play the role, or in extreme scenarios, a direct server ban.[/bold] Non-staff players of this role are not able to authorize ERTs through their faxes.
rmc-fax-responder-rules-guidebook = Read the rules
rmc-fax-responder-rules-accept = I understand
rmc-fax-responder-rules-accept-wait = Please read ({$time})
